{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short first-person horror experience about a light technician who goes through 4 unsettling shifts replacing lamps at different locations. Simple task. Twisted stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple, just\u00a0<strong>Replace all broken lamps.</strong> <br>But in these places, light isn\u2019t the only thing waiting for you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is <strong>linear</strong> from Day 1 to Day 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the main game, you\u2019ll unlock a <strong>Day Selector menu</strong> where you can go back and <strong>find all alternate endings</strong> for each shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day has <strong>a different story, location, and unique endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-realistc visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple twisted endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your ending progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different stories every shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple core gameplay: just replace the lamps!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990870?t=1756878096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990870?t=1756878096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990870/06e7f4177d09be91092d667bce7a637649e1f192/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756878096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990870/06e7f4177d09be91092d667bce7a637649e1f192/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756878096","categories":[{"description":"Single-playe